    "description": "design 0042 §3.9. The master switch is off by default because turning it on costs a location permission, continuous GNSS and a speed series inside every export. 🔴 REWRITTEN 2026-08-09 (design 0051): it used to say 'on the dashboard (adds the Riding watchface)' and both halves became false in the same commit — the watchface picker was removed and the speed module was taken off every face. A sub-line naming a surface the card is no longer on is worse than no sub-line: it sends the user who turned the switch on to look in the wrong place."
