    "description": "Destructive-ish row that discards the stored matrix. Separate from the switch: turning the feature off is not a statement about the mount."
  },
  "settingsGCalibrationCleared": "Calibration cleared.",
  "@settingsGCalibrationCleared": {
    "description": "Snackbar confirming the clear."
  },
  "gConsentTitle": "Turn on the G meter?",
  "@gConsentTitle": {
    "description": "Title of the confirmation dialog. Design 0045 Q2 ruled the switch independent of GPS but NOT free of consent, because Q4 records G values."
  },
  "gConsentRecorded": "Longitudinal and lateral G are written into recorded history and travel inside every diagnostic export.",
  "@gConsentRecorded": {
    "description": "First consequence. Same disclosure rule as the speed dialog: what is recorded is stated before it is recorded, not after."
  },
  "gConsentCalibration": "The feature stays inactive until you calibrate the phone against the frame. The calibration starts right after this.",
  "@gConsentCalibration": {
    "description": "Second consequence. Stated because a switch that turns on and shows nothing reads as broken."
  },
  "gConsentEnable": "Enable",
  "@gConsentEnable": {
