  "rawLogContentsDialogTitle": "This log contains your device's Bluetooth address",
  "rawLogContentsDialogBody": "Raw packet logging is on, so this file includes the frames the device sent — and one of them is the device reporting its own Bluetooth hardware address.\n\nThis is your own hardware, not personal data, and the device already broadcasts it to anything in range. It is kept in the file on purpose: removing it would break the frame checksums that make a capture usable as evidence.\n\nJust be aware of it before posting the file somewhere public.",
